  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengtheing the response to maritime crimes in the Gulf of Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is that the Gulf of Guinea countries are cooperating and coordinating their response to maritime crime, both in
a legal and maritime law enforcement area. This is achieved through strengthening the criminal justice systems and supporting the Inter-regional Coordination Centre (ICC) in their implementation of the Code of Conduct Concerning the Repression of Piracy, Armed Robbery against Ships, and Illicit Maritime Activity in West and Central Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
